OL,3,GNEWSALong delays on M25 due to tunnel
OL,4,Adefect
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere were also still seven miles
OL,7,F(11.3km) of congestion on the approach,
OL,8,Fwith traffic going back to junction
OL,9,Ffour for Orpington on the anticlockwise
OL,10,Fcarriageway.
